name: A file task did not work
description: Help us reproduce a problem with an ordinary work task.
title: "[File task] "
labels: [bug]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Use invented or redistributable files. Remove names, credentials and private information.
        For a security issue, use the private reporting route in SECURITY.md instead.
  - type: textarea
    id: request
    attributes:
      label: What did you ask OpenPaperwork to do?
      description: Paste the request in your own words. Include any later correction.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: expected
    attributes:
      label: What should you have received?
      description: For example, an editable one-page brief with the agreed actions.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: actual
    attributes:
      label: What happened instead?
      description: Include the smallest safe input and output, or describe how to recreate them. Rendered pages help with layout problems.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: environment
    attributes:
      label: Which version and setup did you use?
      description: OpenPaperwork revision or version, operating system, and model/provider if known. Do not paste keys or complete logs containing private data.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: checks
    attributes:
      label: What did you check or fix by hand?
      description: Mention missing facts, broken formatting, repeated requests and anything you could not verify.
